From 1f72db0d8027f1c4c544e7084ab23ec0b0d344b1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gemini Mainline Experiment <gemini-mainline@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 14:46:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] soc: mediatek: capture one bounded pre-patch WMT chip
 reply

Share checked BTIF setup, send only the chip read and retain bounded raw
bytes. No identity acceptance or initialization continuation.

Internal experiment archive; synthetic non-certifying author, no DCO. No
hardware result.

Port onto the Wi-Fi scan line for the combined Phase A profile; logic
unchanged, context adjusted beside the scan-line CONSYS changes.
---
 drivers/soc/mediatek/mt6797-consys.c          |  52 ++++-
 drivers/soc/mediatek/mt6797-wmt-identity-io.h | 187 ++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/soc/mediatek/mt6797-wmt-query.h       |  20 +-
 drivers/soc/mediatek/wmt-identity-read.h      |  31 +++
 4 files changed, 282 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 drivers/soc/mediatek/mt6797-wmt-identity-io.h
 create mode 100644 drivers/soc/mediatek/wmt-identity-read.h

